---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Pipe Fittings — Buttweld & Forged" active="/products">
  <section class="pagebanner">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--blue)">Elbows · Unions · Threadolets</p>
      <h1>Pipe Fittings</h1>
      <p>A wide range of Inconel fittings for automotive, oil & gas, engineering, construction and process industries — corrosion, abrasion and heat resistant, simple to install.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="visual">
    <img src="/product-pipe-fittings.webp" alt="Pipe Fittings product photography" />
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell productcontent">
      <aside>Bhansali Metals<br />Product briefing</aside>
      <div>
<h3>Pipe fittings</h3>
<p>Owing to our rich industrial experience, we offer a wide range of Inconel fittings meeting the application needs of automotive, oil & gas, engineering, construction and various other industries. Designed using advanced technology, these fittings resist corrosion, abrasive chemicals and high temperature. Highly durable and simple to install, they come in different standards and grades — and can be fabricated to specific application requirements.</p>
        <div class="details">
        <div>
          <b>Grades</b>
          <span>Inconel 800 (N08800) · 825 (N08825) · 600 (N06600) · 625 (N06625) · 601 (N06601) · Austenitic stainless steels: ASTM 304/304L and ASTM 316/316L · Duplex stainless steel: SAF 2205 / UNS S31803 / EN 1.4462 · Super-duplex stainless steel: SAF 2507 / UNS S32750 / EN 1.4410</span>
        </div>
        </div>
<h3>Elbow fittings</h3>
<p>Manufactured in line with international quality standards, our range covers SR (short radius) elbows — centre-to-face 1.0 × diameter for tight clearances — and LR (long radius) elbows — 1.5 × diameter where space allows and flow is critical. The elbow changes piping direction (the "quarter bend"); its main duty connects hoses to valves, water pressure pumps and deck drains.</p>
        <div class="details">
        <div>
          <b>Grades</b>
          <span>ASTM/ASME UNS 6600 INCONEL 600 · UNS 6601 INCONEL 601 · UNS 6625 INCONEL 625 · UNS 7718 INCONEL 718 · UNS 7751 INCONEL X-750 · UNS 8800 INCONEL 800 · UNS 8810/11 INCOLOY 800H · UNS 8825 INCOLOY 825 · Austenitic stainless steels: ASTM 304/304L and ASTM 316/316L · Duplex stainless steel: SAF 2205 / UNS S31803 / EN 1.4462 · Super-duplex stainless steel: SAF 2507 / UNS S32750 / EN 1.4410</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Size</b>
          <span>⅛″ NB to 4″ NB (socket-weld & threaded)</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Class</b>
          <span>150#, 300#, 600#, 900#, 1500#, 2000#, 3000#, 6000#, 9000#</span>
        </div>
        </div>
<h3>Union fittings</h3>
<p>Inconel unions for industrial plumbing in various profiles — precision-designed and machined for high strength, toughness and resistance to heat and chemicals. Size ½″ NB to 4″ NB, screwed and socket-weld types.</p>
<h3>Threadolets</h3>
<p>High-quality Inconel threadolets in different technical specifications — accurate design and precision machining for zero-error parts with close tolerances and excellent finishes, and great resistance to heat and corrosion. Size 15 NB to 80 NB.</p>
<p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a class="card-link" href="/technical/pipe-fittings">Open the dimension tables →</a></p>

        <p style="margin-top:2rem">
          <a class="button" href="/enquiry">Request a quote ↗</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>
